{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101240","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1210124001:0":{"text":"だめー！ロンロンから離れなさいー！","source_cn":"住手！不许动满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE15E77AEECE60A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210124002:0":{"text":"こいつを知ってるのか？名前がついてるナマコなんて初めて見たぜ。","source_cn":"你们认识？这海耗子还有名字？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A531A7FDCE8DF47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210124003:0":{"text":"ロンロン、起きて！","source_cn":"满满，你醒醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4910AA4BE87FEA46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210124004:0":{"text":"そんな……顔が真っ青……マスター、ロンロンが全然動きません！","source_cn":"怎么会……他脸色好差……满满他不动了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD4BDB9CA30D441","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210124005:0":{"text":"きっと溺れたんだ！人工呼吸はできるか！？","source_cn":"喂，这溺水得很严重！你们做过人工呼吸吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EBA6225AE8A251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210124006:0":{"text":"じ、人工呼